	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - GPS\n\nu-blox MAX-M10S GNSS. UART -> P4, TIMEPULSE (PPS) -> P4 GPIO (interrupt, time-stamping), RESET_N from P4.\nV_BCKP from supercap/ML1220 for hot start. Active antenna: SMA/u.FL with bias-T + current limit.\nSupply 3V3_GPS (switched, PM3 ch1). Keep RF away from the 1090 MHz SDR area."
